# The design-system CSS vendored into packages/site/public/ by
# `catppuccin-neu-sync` (the site's predev/prebuild/pretest hook) is COMMITTED,
# not ignored: the deploy (Cloudflare Workers Builds) configures its build
# command outside this repo, and if that command bypassed the pnpm prebuild
# hook the marketing page and Worker pages would 404 on /tokens.css et al.
# The hook keeps the committed copies in sync with the package version.

# assets staged for the site's Worker tests
packages/site/test/.assets/

